   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "To: sales@vendor3.example\nSubject: RFQ-2026-014 · two items to complete your quote\n\nDear Vendor 3,\nThank you for your quote. To include it fully in our evaluation, please:\n1. Quote lines 12, 14 and 19, which were missing.\n2. Confirm whether you can offer 60-day payment terms (you quoted 30).\n\nReply directly to this email and we will update your quote automatically.\nRegards, Pavan",
   "originalText": "To: sales@vendor3.example\nSubject: RFQ-2026-014 · two items to complete your quote\n\nDear Vendor 3,\nThank you for your quote. To include it fully in our evaluation, please:\n1. Quote lines 12, 14 and 19, which were missing.\n2. Confirm whether you can offer 60-day payment terms (you quoted 30).\n\nReply directly to this email and we will update your quote automatically.\nRegards, Pavan",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "cjt4492rfcphb3qi",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 11,
   "autoResize": true
  },
